config ZMK_CHECK_BATTERY_BEH
    bool "Enable custom &check_bat implementation"
    help
      When enabled the gamma board (or any board in this module) is
      expected to provide implementations of show_battery() and
      hide_battery(). When disabled the behavior compiles to no-ops.

config GAMMA_HALT_ON_FATAL
    bool "Halt on kernel fatal error instead of resetting"
    help
      Override k_sys_fatal_error_handler to spin in an infinite loop
      after logging the panic, instead of rebooting into the
      bootloader. Useful for capturing the fault site over RTT/SWD.
      Should be left off in production firmware.
